[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798721187","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105301#issuecomment-2798721187","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105301","id":2798721187,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m0Rij","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-12T07:51:56Z","updated_at":"2025-04-12T07:54:46Z","body":"@m4gr3d @Alex2782  I have an alternate solution:\r\n\r\n```java\r\nif (!TextUtils.isEmpty(acceptCharacters)) {\r\n\tif (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.O) {\r\n\t\tedit.setKeyListener(DigitsKeyListener.getInstance(Locale.getDefault(),true,true));\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\tedit.setKeyListener(DigitsKeyListener.getInstance(acceptCharacters));\r\n\t}\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf lacale decimal symbol is period `.` it correctly shows the `decimal keyboard` and allow the `.` and `-` input. `,` and whitespace is not allowed.\r\n\r\nIf lacale decimal symbol is comma `,` it shows the `default keyboard` and only allow digits, `,`, `-`, and `+` input.\r\n\r\nIt also ensures only one decimal point is allowed and restricts the sign (- or +) to the start of the input, which is the correct and expected behavior.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798721187/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798780669","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105301#issuecomment-2798780669","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105301","id":2798780669,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m0gD9","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-12T10:42:34Z","updated_at":"2025-04-12T10:42:34Z","body":"Yes, that seems to be the right solution: forcing `decimal`, because it doesn't seem to be possible for every locale entry.\r\n\r\n```java\r\nDigitsKeyListener.getInstance(Locale.getDefault(), true, true)\r\n```\r\n`Params (Locale locale, boolean sign, boolean decimal)` [docs](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/text/method/DigitsKeyListener#getInstance(java.util.Locale,%20boolean,%20boolean))\r\n\r\n> Returns a DigitsKeyListener that accepts the locale-appropriate digits, plus the locale-appropriate plus or minus sign (only at the beginning) and/or the locale-appropriate decimal separator (only one per field) if specified.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798780669/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2803561118","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105301#issuecomment-2803561118","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105301","id":2803561118,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nGvKe","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-15T02:12:28Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T02:12:28Z","body":"> @m4gr3d @Alex2782 I have an alternate solution:\r\n> \r\n> ```java\r\n> if (!TextUtils.isEmpty(acceptCharacters)) {\r\n> \tif (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.O) {\r\n> \t\tedit.setKeyListener(DigitsKeyListener.getInstance(Locale.getDefault(),true,true));\r\n> \t} else {\r\n> \t\tedit.setKeyListener(DigitsKeyListener.getInstance(acceptCharacters));\r\n> \t}\r\n> }\r\n> ```\r\n> \r\n> If lacale decimal symbol is period `.` it correctly shows the `decimal keyboard` and allow the `.` and `-` input. `,` and whitespace is not allowed.\r\n> \r\n> If lacale decimal symbol is comma `,` it shows the `default keyboard` and only allow digits, `,`, `-`, and `+` input.\r\n> \r\n> It also ensures only one decimal point is allowed and restricts the sign (- or +) to the start of the input, which is the correct and expected behavior.\r\n\r\nThe alternate solution sounds good, let's go with that!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2803561118/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2806977034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105301#issuecomment-2806977034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105301","id":2806977034,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nTxIK","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}